  {
    "source": "The moon is dark, and the gods dance in the night; there is terror in the sky, for upon the moon hath sunk an eclipse foretold in no books of men or of earth's gods...",
    "target": "“月亮黯淡无光，诸神在夜色中起舞；天空中充满恐怖，因为月面上出现了日蚀——它从未在任何人类或大地诸神的典籍中被预言……”",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/data/messages/menu_quotes.txt:17"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "The Moon-God",
    "target": "月神",
    "locations": [
      "src/gods.cpp:21"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "The most merciful thing in the world, I think, is the inability of the human mind to correlate all its contents.",
    "target": "“我认为，世上最仁慈的事，莫过于人类心智无法将自身所有内容联系起来。”",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/data/messages/menu_quotes.txt:23"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "The mummified fourth dynasty Egyptian pharaoh Khephren. How he came to dwell here is beyond anyone's guess.",
    "target": "克弗伦木乃伊——第四王朝的埃及法老。无人知晓他为何会来到此处。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/data/monsters.xml:/monsters/monster[@id=MON_KHEPHREN]/text/description"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
  {
    "source": "The mummified sixth dynasty Egyptian pharaoh Nitokris. How she came to dwell here is beyond anyone's guess. Her name is found in the histories of Herodotus and writings of Manetho. According to the writings of the former, she took the throne by inviting her brother's murderers to a banquet. Then killed them by flooding the sealed room with the Nile.",
    "target": "尼托克丽丝木乃伊——第六王朝的埃及女法老。无人知晓她为何会来到此处。她的名字见于希罗多德的史书和曼涅托的著作。据后者记载，她邀请谋杀兄长的人赴宴，再将尼罗河水灌入密室将他们淹死。",
    "locations": [
      "installed_files/data/monsters.xml:/monsters/monster[@id=MON_NITOKRIS]/text/description"
    ],
    "kind": "ui"
  },
